{
  "widgets": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 24,
      "height": 3,
      "properties": {
        "markdown": "## Servidor web · monitoreo en tiempo real\nInstancia **i-REEMPLAZAR_POR_TU_INSTANCIA** (t3.micro) en la subred pública de la VPC del Módulo 6. Métricas estándar de EC2 cada **5 minutos** (monitoreo básico, sin costo). [Qué significa cada gráfico](https://github.com/MaCecilia92/cloudwatch-dashboard-monitoreo#qué-muestra-cada-widget)"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3,
      "width": 12,
      "height": 7,
      "properties": {
        "title": "CPU del servidor web (%) · CPUUtilization",
        "view": "timeSeries",
        "stacked": false,
        "region": "us-east-1",
        "stat": "Average",
        "period": 300,
        "metrics": [
          [
            "AWS/EC2",
            "CPUUtilization",
            "InstanceId",
            "i-REEMPLAZAR_POR_TU_INSTANCIA",
            {
              "label": "CPU promedio (%)",
              "color": "#ff7f0e"
            }
          ],
          [
            "...",
            {
              "stat": "Maximum",
              "label": "CPU máxima (%)",
              "color": "#d62728"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "yAxis": {
          "left": {
            "min": 0,
            "max": 100,
            "label": "Porcentaje",
            "showUnits": false
          }
        },
        "annotations": {
          "horizontal": [
            {
              "label": "Umbral de Auto Scaling (60 %)",
              "value": 60,
              "color": "#d62728"
            },
            {
              "label": "Línea base t3.micro (10 %)",
              "value": 10,
              "color": "#2ca02c",
              "fill": "below"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 12,
      "y": 3,
      "width": 12,
      "height": 7,
      "properties": {
        "title": "Tráfico de red (bytes cada 5 min) · NetworkIn / NetworkOut",
        "view": "timeSeries",
        "stacked": true,
        "region": "us-east-1",
        "stat": "Sum",
        "period": 300,
        "metrics": [
          [
            "AWS/EC2",
            "NetworkIn",
            "InstanceId",
            "i-REEMPLAZAR_POR_TU_INSTANCIA",
            {
              "label": "Entrada: lo que recibe el servidor",
              "color": "#1f77b4"
            }
          ],
          [
            ".",
            "NetworkOut",
            ".",
            ".",
            {
              "label": "Salida: lo que envía (páginas, archivos)",
              "color": "#9467bd"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "yAxis": {
          "left": {
            "min": 0,
            "label": "Bytes",
            "showUnits": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
